# Copy to .env.production for `npm run build:prod` if you need build-time settings.
#
# The app calls the API and the status WebSocket on the same address the page is served from
# (it builds every URL from the page's own location). VITE_API_BASE_URL and VITE_WS_URL are
# defined in src/config/env.ts but no code reads them, so setting them has no effect.
# To reach a backend on another machine, put a reverse proxy in front that serves this build
# and forwards the API paths and /ws (with WebSocket upgrade) to the backend.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=""
VITE_WS_URL=""
